# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF, regardless of the
# OS/editor a contributor uses to save a file. This is the standard fix
# for CRLF/LF drift on Windows checkouts (see T19, AUTHONCE-BACKLOG.md).
#
# Repo-level, not a per-machine git config — every contributor and every
# clone gets this automatically, no local setup step required.
* text=auto
